Inspect a completed worker's durable execution transcript to see exactly what it did — every tool call, result, and reasoning step. Use without a worker_id to list recent workers. Use with a worker_id to retrieve one completed worker's full transcript; running workers return an explicit unavailable error because their transcript is not durable yet. `limit` applies only when listing. Useful for verifying worker output, debugging incomplete results, or understanding what sources and steps a worker used.
